
                   DayDream BBS V1.00, Message Structure
                   -------------------------------------

OFFSET  TYPE     LENGTH  DESCRIPTION                                     FLAGS
==============================================================================
 0000   WORD       02    NUMBER OF THIS MESSAGE                            (-)
 0002   WORD       02    NEXT REPLY TO THIS MESSAGE OR NULL IF NO REPLIES  (-)
 0004   WORD       02    FLAGS                                             (-)
 0006   STRING     25    AUTHOR              (REAL NAME OR HANDLE)         (-)
 0032   STRING     25    RECEIVER            (REAL NAME OR HANDLE)         (-)
 0058   STRING     67    SUBJECT                                           (-)
 0126   LONG WORD  04    DATE AND TIME OF MESSAGE CREATION                 (1)
 0130   LONG WORD  04    DATE AND TIME WHEN MESSAGE WAS RECEIVED OR NULL   (1)
 0134   WORD       02    MESSAGE READ COUNT                                (-)
 0136   WORD       02    NUMBER OF MESSAGE THIS IS REPLY TO OR NULL        (-)
 0138   STRING     15    PASSWORD REQUIRED TO READ THIS MESSAGE            (-)
 0154   WORD       02    FIDONET: PACKET ORIGIN ZONE                       (-)
 0156   WORD       02    FIDONET: PACKET ORIGIN NET ID                     (-)
 0158   WORD       02    FIDONET: PACKET ORIGIN NODE                       (-)
 0160   WORD       02    FIDONET: PACKET ORIGIN POINT                      (-)
 0162   WORD       02    FIDONET: ORIGIN ZONE                              (-)
 0164   WORD       02    FIDONET: ORIGIN NET ID                            (-)
 0166   WORD       02    FIDONET: ORIGIN NODE                              (-)
 0168   WORD       02    FIDONET: ORIGIN POINT                             (-)
 0170   LONG WORD  04    FIDONET: MSGID (UNIQUE ID NUMBER FOR THE MSG)     (-)
 0174   WORD       02    FIDONET: DESTINATION ZONE                         (-)
 0176   WORD       02    FIDONET: DESTINATION NET ID                       (-)
 0178   WORD       02    FIDONET: DESTINATION NODE                         (-)
 0180   WORD       02    FIDONET: DESTINATION POINT                        (-)
 0182   FREE BLOCK 118   FREE SPACE RESERVED FOR FUTURE DEVELOPMENT        (-)
 0300   END        00    END OF MESSAGE STRUCTURE, NEXT FOLLOWS?           (-)
==============================================================================

BIT   DESCRIPTION                                                MESSAGE FLAGS
==============================================================================
000   0: PUBLIC MESSAGE                1: PRIVATE MESSAGE
001   0: MESSAGE IS ALIVE AND WELL     1: MESSAGE HAS BEEN DELETED
002   0: MESSAGE IS EXPORTED           1: MESSAGE MUST BE EXPORTED
 .
 .
015
==============================================================================

